Every clinician should ask a patient about a drug-use.
Every clinician should ask a patient about an alcohol-use.
Every clinician should screen a mental-health-disorder for a patient.
Every clinician should assess a mental-health-disorder for a patient.
Every clinician should screen a substance-use-disorder for a patient.
Every clinician should assess a substance-use-disorder for a patient.
If a clinician screens a disorder for a patient then the clinician may use a validated-tool and may consult a behavioral-health-specialist.
If a clinician assesses a disorder for a patient then the clinician may use a validated-tool and may consult a behavioral-health-specialist.
